H('4.2 Workflow',2); P('PDF upload → create record and store file → Celery task → PyMuPDF text extraction → Qdrant indexing/retrieval → QA extraction → compliance scan → field audit → optional one-pass repair → rerun compliance and audit → complete or needs_review.')
P('Upload returns a document ID with pending status while a worker processes the file. The client polls for completion. Exceptions set failed status. The README notes that model downloads are substantial and cached in a Docker volume.')
flow=d.add_picture(make_processing_workflow(),width=Inches(6.45)); flow._inline.docPr.set('descr','Invoice processing workflow from PDF upload and asynchronous queue through ingestion, retrieval, extraction, compliance, audit, optional bounded repair, and final status.')
